#  pascal_driver.icn -- the grading vehicle for procs/pascal.icn: it links pascal (and through it math, factors) and
#  exercises pascal(n), which writes an n-row Pascal-triangle "carpet" to &output, for several sizes, a large-integer
#  size, and the default n (16).  Every procedure in the library is exercised.
link pascal
procedure main()
   pascal(1);
   pascal(5);
   pascal(8);
   pascal();
   pascal(70)
end
